title: PrologueFirst
---
NARRATOR: Long ago, the Frog Village thrived in harmony. Bubbles, a father, cherished his tadpoles and his peaceful home. But danger lurked in the shadows.  

NARRATOR: One night, disaster struck. A vengeful alligator snapping turtle stormed the village. Once a pet, abandoned, he hated Bubbles. In a cruel act of revenge, he stole his tadpoles, forcing The Cheese King and his rat army to help.  

NARRATOR: Now, Bubbles must face the dangers of the swamp, battling predators and pushing forward with one goal. To save his children. He won’t be alone. A trusted friend, swears to help however he can.  

NARRATOR: The fate of the village—and the tadpoles—rests in Bubbles' hands.
